{
  "id": "33286b6913c7bb564f55bf1d",
  "title": "我爬上富士山了！",
  "summary": "腳上的痠痛還在，但隨之而來是滿滿的成就感",
  "content": "<div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Ufc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F68a121ec-4c71-447a-baf7-6019278d6249_1477x1108.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Ufc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F68a121ec-4c71-447a-baf7-6019278d6249_1477x1108.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>嗨大家，看到這篇文章的此刻，我已經順利完成富士山登頂，並且平安回到台灣。</p><p>這趟旅行對我來說意義重大，幾乎可說是不可思議，我怎麼可能會去爬山，還是兩天一夜、花十幾個小時才能完成的山，我瘋了嗎？確實，你現在看到的我，已經是只贏 2.0 了。</p><div><p>貼心提醒，本文照片與文字特多，請小心服用。</p><p>前情提要可以參考上篇<strong><a href=\"https://www.onlywin.work/p/4a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《富士山「行前」訓練記》</a>。</strong></p></div><h3>從史詩級豪雨到 A 級大晴天</h3><p>在出發的前幾週，不僅颱風頻繁侵襲，甚至抵達日本的前一天，成田機場還出現<strong>「史詩級豪雨」</strong>，周邊交通一度中斷。我邊整理行李邊看新聞，心想完蛋了，根本是天要亡我啊！</p><p>這時我突然想起民間<strong>「燒烏龜」</strong>的傳說，只要在紙上畫上太陽與烏龜，寫下願望後燒掉就能祈求好天氣。起初伴侶聽到這想法嗤之以鼻地叫我別迷信，但看到我過於焦慮，還是在陽台喬了個位置，陪我認真舉行燒烏龜儀式。</p><p>出發當天，奇蹟真的出現了！</p><p>原本可能襲日的颱風突然轉向，登山指數也轉變成最棒的 A 級，連機場交通也早已恢復順暢，我們順利抵達日本，準備展開隔天的登山任務。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nWYy!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3de641b2-4a56-4c9a-854a-b9223ac7dc5c_4590x3442.heic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nWYy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3de641b2-4a56-4c9a-854a-b9223ac7dc5c_4590x3442.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>就這樣，2026 年 8 月 16 日，一行人在登山口拍下這張歡樂的合照，開心地宣布出發！（此時大家還笑得出來，殊不知接下來的 24 小時，我們將經歷多痛苦的考驗。）</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4L-9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf630b9b-ea21-4f67-a6d0-f23c9d9af56e_2458x1605.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4L-9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf630b9b-ea21-4f67-a6d0-f23c9d9af56e_2458x1605.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"951\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>簡單科普一下富士山路線，大部分的人會從五合目出發，第一天爬到本八合目入住山屋，半夜攻頂看日出，最後再一路下山回到五合目。</p><p>富士山海拔高達 3,776m，總爬升約 1,476m，相當於要爬快三座台北 101 的階梯！隨著海拔上升，氣溫驟降、空氣稀薄，心率幾乎維持在每分鐘 150 下的高速跳動。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pz3J!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbebf3ec1-3b37-4356-99df-6bdf73078e38_1322x580.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pz3J!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbebf3ec1-3b37-4356-99df-6bdf73078e38_1322x580.jpeg\" width=\"1322\" height=\"580\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>圖片來源：網路</figcaption></figure></div><h3>好的開始？才怪！</h3><p>其實在抵達五合目後，我就覺得頭有點微漲想吐，雖然有吃丹木斯預防高山症，但內心還是很緊張。我心想就這樣吧，嘔吐袋都準備好了，真要吐的話，我也會包好帶下山！</p><p>（題外話，山上的所有垃圾都必須自己帶走，這兩天的任何用品都不能破壞環境。）</p><p>在開始攀登約 45 分鐘後，我們順利抵達六合目；然後再一小時，就到了七合目。當時我心想，好像沒有那麼困難耶，原來自己也挺行的嘛！</p><p>我錯了，大錯特錯。</p><p>前面的坡度只是新手村試水溫，七合目到八合目，才是地獄級挑戰的開始。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JENT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc59e2563-81fc-4e28-bcb4-b22225776bb9_3024x1701.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JENT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc59e2563-81fc-4e28-bcb4-b22225776bb9_3024x1701.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yrny!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cd7662-5aab-4ac1-8325-bf7a3dd1c664_3024x1740.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yrny!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cd7662-5aab-4ac1-8325-bf7a3dd1c664_3024x1740.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"838\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>連續不停歇的陡峭岩壁</h3><p>七合目之後的步道變成需要手腳並用的陡峭岩壁。</p><p>我把登山杖收進背包，全神貫注在每一個步伐上，岩石又大又陡且略帶濕滑，兩側就是峭壁，為了保命，我只能克服恐懼，緊抓每一顆石頭踩穩前進。雖然每到山屋能稍作喘息，但為了防止體溫流失，也不敢停留太久。</p><p>我真的又累又喘，美英體力不錯，還有餘裕幫大家拍照記錄，但秋明早已累到毫無笑容，映映更是筋疲力盡無法開口（但休息時仍不忘抓皮克敏）。我只能不斷催眠自己：腳抬起來就能往前；只要繼續走，很快就到了。</p><p>才怪！真的走好久！</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ITOe!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0603a1cb-e2f4-46fd-a887-f6b434e3cac0_1706x960.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ITOe!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0603a1cb-e2f4-46fd-a887-f6b434e3cac0_1706x960.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCtm!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F630d07ba-6c90-4459-ab4e-298f2a40806c_1706x960.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCtm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F630d07ba-6c90-4459-ab4e-298f2a40806c_1706x960.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>「轉個彎就到了」是山友的共同騙術</h3><p>爬過三次富士山的 Bob 說，我們入住的是八合目中最高的山屋，這樣安排能讓隔天攻頂<strong>「稍微」</strong>輕鬆一點。隨後他鼓舞大家：<strong>「再一個半小時，就會到我們住的山屋囉！」</strong></p><p>我看著手錶心想，你別再騙我了，一小時前你也是這麼說的！明明已經走了很久，為什麼還沒到？為什麼還沒到！（人在累的時候真的很想發脾氣XD）</p><p>原來，<strong>「轉個彎就到了」</strong>是全天下山友騙人前進的共通術語。</p><p>但說也神奇，只要抱著<strong>「快到了」</strong>的念頭，似乎真能再擠出一點力量。就在小腿快要抽筋、腳底板痠痛無比的極限時刻，繞過下個轉角，我們的山屋終於到了（尖叫）！</p><p>圍坐在一起吃著熱呼呼晚餐的那一刻，簡直是這漫長六小時攀爬後最大的救贖。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DUxa!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41f5bead-592a-4d12-bb10-641eefbab6cc_4032x2268.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DUxa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41f5bead-592a-4d12-bb10-641eefbab6cc_4032x2268.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ylEu!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F000c05fd-e843-4ce4-a0cb-663ed3c9b96e_4590x3442.heic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ylEu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F000c05fd-e843-4ce4-a0cb-663ed3c9b96e_4590x3442.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>夜行頭燈河，摸黑大冒險</h3><p>快速用完晚餐並寫完明信片後，約莫晚上八點我們就準備就寢，因為隔天凌晨十二點，就得起床準備攻頂！</p><p>你沒看錯，是半夜十二點出發攻頂，代表我們只有四個小時的休息時間。高海拔加上起伏的打呼聲與陸續出發的人潮，別說沉睡了，能讓身體躺著休息已是萬幸。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3GPa!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00b34e78-17c8-434d-9fc2-942f9d54bc5b_4032x2268.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3GPa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00b34e78-17c8-434d-9fc2-942f9d54bc5b_4032x2268.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>休息四小時的山屋</figcaption></figure></div><p>清晨山頂氣溫直逼 0 度，我穿上所有防寒外套與毛帽走出山屋，外面早已大排長龍。整條山道都是移動的夜行頭燈河，綿延不絕，場面極其壯觀。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IUf4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b8417a2-4881-46da-979f-757e25429a24_1280x960.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IUf4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2b8417a2-4881-46da-979f-757e25429a24_1280x960.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>一整排都是準備上山的人潮</figcaption></figure></div><p>摸黑前進了大約三個小時，在我筋疲力盡抬頭的那一刻，終於看見了日本最高的神社——頂上淺間大社奧宮。</p><p>天啊！我們終於爬到山頂了！</p><p>清晨四點多，四周暈染成美麗的橘光，搭配翻騰的雲海，那一幕的美景我這輩子都不會忘記。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!c6oU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57f09ac0-2bba-48b7-a160-7a25b8028aab_4590x3442.heic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!c6oU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57f09ac0-2bba-48b7-a160-7a25b8028aab_4590x3442.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D6qE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F691a114d-4453-4220-97b8-918baa0d7572_4032x2268.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D6qE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F691a114d-4453-4220-97b8-918baa0d7572_4032x2268.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>極限邊緣的火山口「鉢巡」</h3><p>不過，抵達山頂還不算結束，我們還要挑戰最具儀式感的<strong>「鉢巡」</strong>，也就是繞著火山口走一圈。這段路程需額外耗費 1.5 小時，期間還會有些許上坡，對於熬夜又經歷六小時高強度攀登的我們來說，體力早已透支。</p><p>當大家圍一圈猶豫時，映映率先熱血說出：<strong>「人都來了，一定要繞一下的啊！」</strong></p><p>我知道，只要大家聚在一起，就會產生無窮的力量。就這樣，我們拖著疲憊的雙腿，左邊是懸崖、右邊是火山口，在黑夜與晨光交界處彼此打氣，一步一步繞著火山口前進。</p><p>當看到日出緩緩升起、照亮火山口的那一瞬間，真的美到令人窒息。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P7xT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ccbc7fc-0a80-4d3d-9449-d52c530bb7de_1706x960.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P7xT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ccbc7fc-0a80-4d3d-9449-d52c530bb7de_1706x960.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lif3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59159c37-bc10-4587-9aa4-f90b487b0246_1108x831.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lif3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59159c37-bc10-4587-9aa4-f90b487b0246_1108x831.jpeg\" width=\"1108\" height=\"831\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>最終，我們站上富士山最高點<strong>「劍鋒」</strong>。</p><p>看著太陽躍出雲海，大家尖叫歡呼。能成功登頂並不容易，不僅需要體能、耐受高山反應，更需要老天爺賜予好天氣。而能和全家人還有映映一起登上富士山山頂，親眼看見傳說中的「御來光」，是多麼無與倫比的幸運！</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ddVa!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59b93929-4960-40d2-901c-a7ccabca28d3_1477x1108.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ddVa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59b93929-4960-40d2-901c-a7ccabca28d3_1477x1108.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jZ9Y!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5d9d5439-4fc1-4159-ae70-cee1fbcda36c_1706x960.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jZ9Y!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5d9d5439-4fc1-4159-ae70-cee1fbcda36c_1706x960.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>與劍峰的珍貴合影</h3><p>下面這張照片，是我最喜歡的一張合照，感謝充滿儀式感的映映，特地帶著<strong>「富士山登頂」</strong>的布條，讓我們一起在劍鋒前留下珍貴的合影。</p><p>真難想像，美英和秋明兩位 60+ 的人，就這樣一起爬上山；Bob 雖然已經爬第三次，但這是他第一次順利攻頂（第一次遇到颱風、第二次高山症發作），而局局看起來游刃有餘，果然是年輕人啊！</p><p>最厲害的是我和映映，平常我們都是吃喝玩樂的聚會，但這幾個月彼此督促，不僅健康飲食還加強重訓，甚至每次相約都在爬山。</p><p>我們是誰？我們已經不是過去的懶豬女孩，現在的我們，可是爬過富士山的女人啊！</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Tra2!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9182e045-7eea-45ae-abb5-91e236542e29_1477x1108.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Tra2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9182e045-7eea-45ae-abb5-91e236542e29_1477x1108.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vj3L!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddd82cbf-eef1-4dcc-ab29-a95dd36a8410_4590x3442.heic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vj3L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddd82cbf-eef1-4dcc-ab29-a95dd36a8410_4590x3442.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>下山才是考驗的開始</h3><p>如果你以為旅程到這裡就完美落幕，那可就錯了，因為真正的考驗才剛要開始。</p><p>富士山下山的路又滑又陡，全是碎石碎屑，每一步都必須小心翼翼。為了防止跌倒並減緩膝蓋的劇痛，我試著腳跟著地、外八或側身前進，甚至倒退走，但怎樣都不對，因為每一步都好痛苦！</p><p>即便鞋帶已經綁到最緊，腳趾依然不斷頂到鞋頭，小腿與膝蓋更是痛到不行。</p><p>這下山的路，根本不合理啊！</p><p>秋明甚至憤怒地說出：「這種坡度是違法的，不可以這樣設計！」等語無倫次的言論 XD</p><p>我終於懂什麼叫<strong>「爬到懷疑人生」</strong>，因為真的爬到好生氣，尤其當你已經感到絕望，前方卻依然是看不到盡頭的下坡，只能強忍痛苦繼續往前進。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4kue!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdae7fbc4-430f-4a87-b06d-ff23876fb4b1_1477x1108.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4kue!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdae7fbc4-430f-4a87-b06d-ff23876fb4b1_1477x1108.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Oqqy!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F040eee32-3552-4921-9874-854572a10d5e_1706x960.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Oqqy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F040eee32-3552-4921-9874-854572a10d5e_1706x960.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>在爬富士山前，我常聽別人分享<strong>「下山比上山難」</strong>，當時我還半信半疑，如今我深刻體會所言不假，直到此刻寫下這段回憶，我都還能想起當時膝蓋那種炸痛感。</p><p>更驚險的是，我們預約上午 11 點回東京車站的巴士，要是沒搭上，就得另外想辦法回去。Bob 早已在山下等候，隔空吩咐大家忍痛加速前進，我們雙腿累到極致卻一步都不敢停。</p><p>美英在旁邊不斷鼓勵我，秋明和映映則在後方努力，而局局不知道哪來的神力，居然還有體力衝去山腳下的置物櫃，幫大家把換洗衣物取出（謝謝妹妹，我們愛妳！）</p><p>憑著<strong>「絕對不能錯過公車」</strong>的強烈執念，以及一路上的相互打氣，我們壓線搭上巴士。</p><p>抵達山下後，我們轉過身，深深地向富士山敬禮。</p><p>謝謝山神保佑我們一路平安，謝謝山神讓我們體驗大自然的美好，更謝謝山神賜予我們超幸運的無敵大晴天。這趟兩天一夜的旅程極其不易，但我會永遠記得，在 2026 年的這個時刻，我們全家人還有映映，一起站上了富士山山頂。</p><p>這將是我一輩子最珍貴、最難忘的登山回憶。</p><div><hr></div><p><strong>後記：</strong></p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vv1K!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe069a8c2-10da-4cdf-b9f2-d7cda861d8f3_1378x843.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vv1K!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe069a8c2-10da-4cdf-b9f2-d7cda861d8f3_1378x843.jpeg\" width=\"1378\" height=\"843\" alt=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>登頂成功的隔天，Bob 特地訂了全亞洲唯一一間的<strong>「Peter Luger」</strong>帶大家一起慶祝，甚至還請餐廳準備<strong>「富士山登頂成功」</strong>的客製蛋糕。不僅牛排好吃，服務更是沒話說，最後主廚還熱情與我們合影，替這趟旅程劃下最棒的句點。</p><p>痠痛會過去，成就感會留下。</p><p>發文的此刻，腳上的水泡已逐漸消退，雖然瘀青的指甲還在，但膝蓋也慢慢復原，人體的自癒能力真神奇，看來，又可以開始準備下一座山了！（開玩笑的並沒有）</p><p>回程的時候，伴侶特地幫我搶到最後一個右邊靠窗的位置，當我坐在飛機上，從窗外俯瞰整座富士山時，全身起雞皮疙瘩。真難想像那一晚，大家明明已經疲憊到極致，還能相互打氣，一起完成火山口鉢巡。</p><p>對我來說，我從不特別追求要完成什麼壯烈的人生清單，我想要的，一直都是大家聚在一起；光是彼此陪伴的過程，對我而言，就已經是最大的意義。</p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pdAG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4f55b5f-e7ad-454d-96e0-b54d00231973_4032x2268.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pdAG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4f55b5f-e7ad-454d-96e0-b54d00231973_4032x2268.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div>",
